  situationName: The Nearby Traveller Moves On
  act: Stay hidden and keep watching the nearby person.
  situationDescription: After waiting silently, you finally see the nearby traveller
    cross a gap in the trees carrying a merchant's pack marked with goods from a
    nearby settlement. They pause only to adjust the load, then continue toward the
    road. The markings and direction give you a useful clue about current trader
    movement.
